Edit,تعديل
You can adjust the scope of this synonym group by selecting an option from the list.,يمكنك ضبط نطاق مرادفات هذه المجموعة بتحديد الخيار من القائمة.
Scope,مدى
"Comma-separated list of synonyms. The terms entered (separated by commas) will be used as an “OR” search query to search your entire store. For example, if you enter “shoes,footwear”, and user were to search for ""shoes"", the search results will include any product or content with term “shoes"" or ""footwear.”","Comma-separated list of synonyms. The terms entered (separated by commas) will be used as an “OR” search query to search your entire store. For example, if you enter “shoes,footwear”, and user were to search for ""shoes"", the search results will include any product or content with term “shoes"" or ""footwear.”"
Synonyms,مرادفات
"Automatically merges synonyms in groups that share the same scope. If you check this box and you add one or more of the same terms to different synonym groups in the same scope, automatically merges all the terms to one group. If this isn't what you want, uncheck the box and an error displays if you try to add the same terms.",تلقائياً يتم دمج المرادفات في المجموعات التي تشترك في نفس النطاق. يمكنك تحديد هذا المربع ويمكنك بإضافة واحد أو أكثر من الشروط نفسها إلى مرادفات مجموعات مختلفة في نفس النطاق، يدمج تلقائياً جميع المصطلحات إلى مجموعة واحدة. إذا لم يكن هذا ما تريد، قم بإلغاء تحديد المربع وسيتم عرض الخطأ عند محاولة إضافة نفس الشروط.
Merge existing synonyms,Merge existing synonyms
